(Step10 activate_destination_node DA DN RTP: no negative.)
(Step11 load_destination_payload DA DN Cargo: negative effect (not cargo_available Cargo). Cargo becomes false again.)
(Step12 unload_destination_payload DA DN Cargo: negative effect (not destination_payload_linked DA Cargo). effect cargo_available true.)
(Step13 detach_task_profile DA RTP: negative effect (not candidate_task_profile_linked DA RTP). makes RTP available.)
