(Step16 authorize_transport_leg_loading TL OA RTP: no negative.)
(Step17 execute_schedule_dispatch SCa VG DSS: negative effects? None; effect adds dispatched, vehicle_available VG, dispatch_slot_available DSS. No removals.)
(Step18 release_compliance_certificate SCa CC: negative effect (not candidate_compliance_certificate_linked SCa CC). So link removed, compliance_certificate_available true.)
